WEBVTT

00:09:29.857 --> 00:09:32.714
Leo, ni halisi.

00:09:32.714 --> 00:09:35.075
Mwezi jana, hatimaye tulipata

00:09:35.075 --> 00:09:38.325
muhuri wa kitaaluma kwa muundo wetu.

00:09:38.325 --> 00:09:42.259
Chuo kikuu cha watu sasa kina kibali rasmi

00:09:42.259 --> 00:09:43.407
(Makofi)

00:09:43.407 --> 00:09:49.307
Asanteni.

00:09:49.307 --> 00:09:50.951
Kwa kibali hichi,

00:09:50.951 --> 00:09:54.052
ni wakati wetu sasa kupaa

00:09:54.052 --> 00:09:57.953
Tumeonyesha kwamba muundo wetu
unafanya kazi.

00:09:57.953 --> 00:10:01.280
nakaribisha vyuo vikuu, na maana zaidi,